========================================
Glossary
========================================

   Exposure Specifications Glossary:
       FrameRead = Frame Read Time                       
       Groups = Number of Groups per Integration         
       NFrame = Number of Frames per Group               
       GrpGap = Gap between groups, based on readout pattern
       Ints = Number of Integrations per Exposure        
       PhotonCollect (sec) = FrameReadTime * ((Groups * NFrame) + ((Groups - 1) * GrpGap)) * Ints
       Diths = Number of Dithers                         
       PrimDiths = Number of Primary Dithers             
       SecDiths = Number of Secondary Dithers            
       NumExp = Number of Exposures                      
       TotalPhoton = PhotonCollect * Diths * NumExp      
       Exposure Setup = Duration of exposure configuration overhead
       Exposure Duration = Photon collect time + reset overhead + exposure setup + exposure cleanup
       Exposing Duration = Photon collect time + reset overhead

========================================
   Visit Durations Glossary:
       Instrument overhead = (sum of all items in parentheses)
       SAMs = Small Angle Maneuvers                      
       GS Acq = Guide Star Acquisition time              
       Targ Acq = Target Acquisition time                
       Exp Ovhd = Exposure Overheads                     
       Mech = Mechanism motion overhead                  
       OSS = Onboard Script overheads, compile time, etc.
       MSA = MSA configuration change overhead           
       IRS2 = Overhead for changing IRS2 status          
       Visit Ovhd = Visit Overheads                      
       Observatory Overhead = 0.16 * (Science Duration + Instrument Overhead + Slew Time)
       Direct Sched Overhead = Tight Timing / Rapid Target Of Opportunity overhead
       Total Time Charged = Science Duration + Instrument Overhead + Slew Time + Observatory Overhead + Direct Sched Overhead

       NOTE: Total Exposure Time as seen in the APT GUI has not been added to this report at this time.

